          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گھرنا (ghirnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin ghirnā, \"to be surrounded\", under ghir, \"go round\", a form it reconstructs (CDIAL 4474)."
